[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0526","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0526.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1326","title":"Qualcomm Eudora 5.1 隐藏附件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Qualcomm Eudora 5.1 邮件客户端存在隐藏附件执行漏洞。当用户启用\"使用 Microsoft Viewer\"选项且禁用\"允许 HTML 内容中的可执行文件\"选项时，远程攻击者可向目标用户发送特制 HTML 邮件，通过将表单伪装为图片链接诱导用户点击，从而触发表单执行并访问邮件中嵌入的附件，最终导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Eudora 5.1 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1326"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02Z","remediation":"升级到 Eudora 6.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复通过 HTML 邮件表单触发隐藏附件执行的问题。如无法升级，请在 Eudora 设置中关闭\"Use Microsoft Viewer\"选项（Tools → Options → Viewing Mail → Use Microsoft Viewer），并禁止在 HTML 内容中执行可执行文件。由于 Qualcomm 已停止维护 Eudora，建议迁移至 Thunderbird 等仍在安全更新的邮件客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/187128","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2796","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20888","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1326.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1326","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1326.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1326.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5c5-4448-qwxw/GHSA-m5c5-4448-qwxw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1326.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2796/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3eab45ad-952c-42d4-9050-4236488e62ee.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0526.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0410","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0410.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1349","title":"Sendmail Sendmail 信号处理器竞争条件漏洞","description":"Sendmail 8.11.4 之前版本及 8.12.0.Beta10 之前版本中存在信号处理程序条件竞争漏洞。本地攻击者利用该漏洞可触发竞态条件，导致堆内存损坏和拒绝服务，并可能进一步实现本地权限提升。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需本地用户权限，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1349"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05Z","remediation":"建议升级 Sendmail 至 8.11.4 及以上版本，或 8.12.0.Beta10 及以上版本。该漏洞为信号处理程序中的条件竞争，攻击者需本地登录系统，因此可限制非授信用户对 sendmail 二进制文件的执行权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/sendmail/2001-q2/0001.html","http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_sm8120.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-106.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6633.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/187127","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2794","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2001/CVE-2001-1349.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1349","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e777505839