ithub.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/10de5f989525302a3452d86be5a85058aa88a086/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1028.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/40e5791b176b832cb09323d3962abe2fe3249e34/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8m7q-cgwx-wx4v/GHSA-8m7q-cgwx-wx4v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1028.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1028.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--14eb8252-dbeb-442f-b80b-8f6e2550ddc4.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0531","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0531.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1335","title":"ACLogic CesarFTP 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ACLogic CesarFTP 0.98b 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程认证用户（包括匿名用户）可通过向 FTP 服务发送包含 `...%5c`（编码后的修改点点点）的 GET 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。攻击者无需特殊权限，仅需具备 FTP 登录凭证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，建议升级至最新版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1335"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 CesarFTP 0.98b，迁移至其他受支持的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（默认 21）的访问来源 IP，并禁用匿名登录以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0252.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6606.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2786","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20884","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1335.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1335","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1335.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1335.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rjvw-2m2q-26gv/GHSA-rjvw-2m2q-26gv.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cesarftp_overflows.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1335.md","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.0/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--feed1b00-2f2b-490f-aee1-0de5b1fbf732.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1335.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0531.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0540","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1347","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 调试寄存器本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 2000系统在处理硬件断点时存在安全漏洞，当本地用户通过全局调试寄存器设置硬件断点时，会引发系统异常，导致其他进程终止并破坏资源完整性。该漏洞影响Windows 2000操作系统，攻击者无需远程认证即可通过操控硬件断点触发系统异常，从而造成拒绝服务和权限提升，严重威胁系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1347"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Windows Server 2019/2022），Windows 2000 已于 2010 年 7 月终止支持，不再接收安全更新。如无法升级，通过本地安全策略限制非管理员用户的交互式登录权限，并在组策略中移除 Users 组的\"调试程序\"特权（SeDebugPrivilege），防止低权限用户设置硬件断点触发异常导致系统崩溃或提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0232.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6590.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2764","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20880","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1347.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1347","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1347.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1347.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r82g-mccm-57gx/GHSA-r82g-mccm-57gx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1347.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1347.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cd8093d1-8ee7-4eb9-bfae-ef5bb5b0737a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0540.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0540.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0534","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1339","title":"Beck IPC IPC@CHIP Telnet服务暴力破解漏洞","description":"Beck IPC GmbH IPC@CHIP 嵌入式控制器的 TelnetD 服务存在暴力破解漏洞，其 telnet 登录服务在用户输入错误密码后不会延迟响应或主动断开连接，导致远程攻击者可利用自动化工具对登录账户进行无限制的密码暴力枚举攻击。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过网络远程实施攻击，一旦成功破解弱口令即可完全控制目标设备，获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响 IPC@CHIP 系列嵌入式控制器，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。厂商建议用户禁用 Telnet 服务或限制可访问 IP 地址以缓解风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1339"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:04Z","remediation":"立即禁用 IPC@CHIP 设备上的 Telnet 服务，改用 SSH 进行远程管理。在网络边界防火墙上限制对 IPC@CHIP Telnet 端口（默认 23/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。如设备固件仍受厂商支持，请访问 HMS Networks（原 Beck IPC）支持页面 https://www.anybus.com/support 检查是否有最新固件更新。若设备已停产或不再获得厂商支持，建议将 IPC@CHIP 替换为受支持的工业通信控制器，并启用登录失败锁定和延迟机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/06/msg00010.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6605.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/198979","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/186418","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2771","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1339.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1339","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1339.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1339.json","https://github.com/bb1nfosec/Information-Security-Tasks/blob/a4c21580c9d241a4b504c8bf598a4dcb04efc7d6/feeds/2026-06-07.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g6wr-5r3p-f3v9/GHSA-g6wr-5r3p-f3v9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1339.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2771/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-307.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0539","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1346","title":"Computer Associates ARCserveIT 临时文件任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Computer Associates ARCserveIT 6.61 和 6.63 客户端版本在创建临时文件 asagent.tmp 和 inetd.tmp 时未进行安全检查，存在竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时文件创建前建立指向敏感系统文件的符号链接，诱导进程将数据写入目标文件，实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞需本地访问权限且攻击复杂度高（CVSS 1.2，AV:L/AC:H），仅影响文件完整性，可导致关键配置或系统文件被篡改，进而引发权限提升或服务中断。Computer Associates 已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1346"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-05-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ARCserveIT 至 6.66 或更高版本，以修复临时文件符号链接漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可采取以下临时缓解措施：将 /tmp 目录权限设置为 1777 并启用 sticky bit，同时通过 crontab 定期清理 /tmp 下的 inetd.tmp 和 asagent.tmp 文件，或在 asagent 启动脚本中预先创建这两个空文件并设置不可修改权限，防止普通用户通过符号链接覆盖系统关键文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0184.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2741","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2748","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20868","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1346.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1346","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1346.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1346.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-35xx-5qr2-qpwp/GHSA-35xx-5qr2-qpwp.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1346.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2741/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e42e2820-cf34-4345-ba4e-99dc1752e456.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0539.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0539.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0405","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1323","title":"MIT Kerberos krb5 FTP 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 5（krb5）1.2.2 及更早版本中的 radix_encode 函数在处理 ftpglob 函数返回的文件通配符输出时，未能正确校验 base-64 编码数据的长度边界，导致发生缓冲区溢出（CWE-120）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 base-64 编码数据包触发该漏洞，进而使目标 Kerberos 服务崩溃拒绝服务，严重情况下可被利用执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 Kerberos 的各类 Linux 系统，包括 Red Hat Linux 7.0 至 7.2、Mandrake Linux 8.1 至 8.2 以及 MandrakeSoft Multi Network Firewall 2.0 等发行版，攻击条件宽松，无需身份验证且无需用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1323"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:02Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 5 至 1.2.3 或更高版本，并重新编译 ftpd。如暂无法立即升级，可下载并应用 MIT 2001 年 4 月发布的 ftpbuf_122_patch.txt 补丁后重新编译 ftpd；同时在 ftpd 配置中禁用匿名 FTP 登录作为临时缓解措施，限制攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-022-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98826223517788&w=2","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/ftpbuf.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-060.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/562a69670cdcc145f6e21df0324d598ba02be73f/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1323","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aab9feabdc7192f1040b6d0a4deb6b961232c23a/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1323.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f662aefd57cf19d7b12805142827e1495046a606/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cwm9-wqpm-mx67/GHSA-cwm9-wqpm-mx67.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1323.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88034/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1323.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2bf9d329-bc34-41e1-a682-191d26ed6180.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0408","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1333","title":"CUPS pstopdf 临时文件符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"` prefix that seems to have been accidentally included in the field value.\n\nWait, looking more carefully at the TOML:\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\n标签之间\n\n要求：\n...\n```\n\nThe description starts with \"标签之间\" which seems like leftover template text. The actual description content starts after that. But the quality checker says it's empty, which is strange.\n\nActually wait - looking at the TOML more carefully, I see:\n```\ndescription = \"\"\"\n标签之间\n\n要求：\n- 中文\n- ≥50字\n- 涵盖原理、影响范围、攻击条件、利用方式\n- 改写为流畅中文，不编造\n\n让我组织描述：\n\nCVE-2001-1333 是 Linux CUPS...\n```\n\nSo the description field contains a lot of template/instruction text that shouldn't be there. The actual description content is mixed with instructions. The quality checker likely sees this as invalid or the actual description is considered empty because of the formatting issues.\n\nActually, re-reading the task more carefully - the user says \"description 字段为空\" but the field clearly has content. The issue might be that the content includes the template instructions mixed in, making it invalid.\n\nBut wait - the user's task says \"请修复 [description] 字段\" and \"只输出 <value>...\n","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1333"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03Z","remediation":"tags as specified.<value>立即将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.6 或更高版本以修复临时文件符号链接漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可临时限制 /var/spool/cups 目录权限为 700，防止本地用户利用符号链接攻击覆盖文件。各发行版用户应分别应用 SUSE-SA:2002:005、MDKSA-2001:048、CLA-2001:384 或 CLA-2001:386 官方安全补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000384","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000386","http://lists2.suse.com/archive/suse-security-announce/2001-Mar/0000.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-048.php3","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1ba39e3ba737b838bba789f1cc5a339b5a2399ad/2008/CVE-2008-5377.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c7415a52c8c7c49b12758f6cb68d7d41d1190b12/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1333","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/333d3943ba23bf18333ea9f9256241d1bb61356e/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1333.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12664c75fe6d00113fe15964cee65a90965e367a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvch-hcwr-7gw3/GHSA-gvch-hcwr-7gw3.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2008-5377.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2008-5377","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1333.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-048.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0407","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1332","title":"Linux CUPS 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Linux CUPS（Common UNIX Printing System）1.1.6 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。漏洞原理在于打印服务对输入数据长度校验不足，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向网络可达的 CUPS 服务发送特制请求或数据，触发缓冲区溢出并可能执行任意代码。影响范围覆盖运行存在漏洞版本 CUPS 的 Linux 系统（如当时的 SuSE、Mandrake、Conectiva 等发行版），攻击条件为服务对外开放且攻击者可网络访问目标。CVSS 评分为 7.5（高危），可导致机密性、完整性与可用性受损。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1332"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03Z","remediation":"将 CUPS 升级至 1.1.6 或更高版本（如发行版提供的 cups 安全更新包）；无法立即升级时，在防火墙限制 631 端口仅允许受信内网访问，或临时停止 cupsd 服务并关闭对外打印共享。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000384","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000386","http://lists2.suse.com/archive/suse-security-announce/2001-Mar/0000.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-048.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5b3647aa8630e92d52def237a668e1c7c212a696/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1332","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/035716a784b26bf707cbf0b8f17696c9c2e71cb8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1332.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fcbf67340ce1edbb3b64d6d36eabe3c12bd2904b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1332.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jgj6-r3rj-29cw/GHSA-jgj6-r3rj-29cw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1332.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1332.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150800_150900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b341df97-9999-4a3e-bd3b-cbf6ef1904f2.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-048.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0999","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0194","title":"Apple CUPS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CUPS（Common UNIX Printing System）1.1.5 版本的 httpGets 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 CUPS Web 管理接口发送超长输入行触发该溢出，从而在服务器上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 CUPS 1.1.5 的各类 UNIX 及 Linux 系统，由于 CUPS 是多数 Linux 发行版默认的打印系统，受影响面较广。攻击者成功利用后可完全控制目标主机，包括窃取敏感数据、安装后门或进一步横向移动。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0194"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"升级 CUPS 到 1.1.6 或更高版本（例如 1.1.7 或 1.1.8），并确保系统已应用 Debian DSA-036 或相应的安全补丁。如无法立即应用补丁，可在防火墙中暂时阻止对打印服务端口（例如 631/tcp）的外部访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-020.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6064","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6043","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0194","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a293285bf198645eacfa1fb6bdd6757780626e5/2001/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0194.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0194.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0194.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0908","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0908.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0180","title":"Lars Ellingsen guestserver.cgi 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Lars Ellingsen guestserver.cgi 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在 email 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等），从而在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响运行 guestserver.cgi 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需登录即可通过构造恶意的 email 字段参数触发漏洞，完全控制受影响的主机系统。由于漏洞利用条件极低且攻击效果为任意代码执行，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击者可利用该漏洞获取服务器权限、窃取敏感数据或进一步渗透内网。建议立即升级或打补丁修复 guestserver.cgi，并对输入参数进行严格的过滤与转义。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0180"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Guestserver 5.x 或更高版本，该版本已修复 email 参数的 shell 元字符注入问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用或删除 guestserver.cgi 脚本，并在 Web 服务器层面对包含分号、竖线、反引号、美元符号等 shell 元字符的 email 参数请求实施拦截。同时应对 email 字段进行严格的输入验证，仅允许合法的电子邮件格式字符，禁止传入特殊符号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0471.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6027","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0180.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0180.json","https://github.co