器对象缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Visual Studio 6.0 Enterprise Edition 中的 VB-TSQL 调试器对象 vbsdicli.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络向调试器发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可执行任意代码，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Visual Basic 和 Visual Studio 6.0 用户，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0153"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-018 提供的补丁，下载地址为 https://msdn2.microsoft.com/vstudio/Aa718356。受影响用户应将 Visual Studio 6.0 Enterprise Edition 升级至 Service Pack 6 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，应在路由器或防火墙层面阻止端口 137-139 和 445 的入站流量，以阻断来自互联网的远程利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_vbtsql.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-018","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0153","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f633ee26df31c8f5776009de314413a57041bf98/2001/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0153.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0153.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0153.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0888.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0809","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0809.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0147","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 事件查看器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Windows 2000 的事件查看器管理单元存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户通过 Microsoft 管理控制台查看事件记录的详细视图时，系统对事件记录中某个字段的处理存在缺陷，远程攻击者可以构造恶意的格式化事件记录数据并发送至目标系统，诱使目标用户在事件查看器中打开该记录，从而触发缓冲区溢出并在系统上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 操作系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0147"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-013 发布的安全补丁 KB285156，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 3（SP3）即可彻底修复该漏洞。补丁下载地址为 Microsoft Download Center（FamilyId=2BA6B2F3-9BB7-4ECF-8B46-47DB89BA86CE），可在运行 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 或 Service Pack 2 的系统上直接安装。安装后可通过检查注册表路径 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Updates\\Windows 2000\\SP3\\Q285156 确认补丁已生效。如受环境限制无法立即打补丁，建议在防火墙层面限制对 Windows 2000 系统事件日志服务的远程写入访问，并避免以管理员身份打开来源不可信的事件记录详细信息页面，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-013","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8798e9cd5ef72b150fb2d268c425b46a0c6a1408/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0147.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0147","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0147.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0147.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424